<article class="investor-report" data-investor-report="plan">
<%- include('../partials/admin/report-header.ejs',{reportTitle:'12-MONTH PLAN + PROSPECTIVE',subtitle:'Rencana 12 Bulan dan Prospektif'}) %>
<% const asset = report.asset; const plan = report.plan; const accounting = plan.accounting; const amount = value => value === null ? 'Unavailable — incomplete historical cost data' : formatIdr(value); %>
<section><h3>1. Executive Summary</h3><p>This report separates actual recorded performance, current asset position, operational priorities and evidence-based prospective indicators. It makes no growth or funding assumptions.</p></section>
<section><h3>2. Current Business Position — Actual / Current Position</h3><dl class="report-metrics">
<dt>Current known inventory units</dt><dd><%= asset.knownUnits %></dd><dt>Inventory HPP value</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %></dd><dt>Inventory retail value</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %></dd><dt>Fixed asset acquisition value</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.fixedValue) %></dd>
<dt>Completed POS / Webstore sales</dt><dd data-plan-sales><%= accounting.saleCount %></dd><dt>Actual revenue</dt><dd data-plan-revenue><%= formatIdr(accounting.revenue) %></dd><dt>Known historical COGS subtotal</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(accounting.knownCogs) %></dd><dt>Total historical COGS</dt><dd><%= amount(accounting.cogs) %></dd><dt>Gross profit</dt><dd><%= amount(accounting.grossProfit) %></dd><dt>Operating expenses</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(accounting.operatingExpenses) %></dd><dt>Net profit</dt><dd><%= amount(accounting.netProfit) %></dd><dt>Cash Flow ending balance</dt><dd data-plan-cash><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.endingBalance) %></dd>
</dl></section>
<section><h3>3. Inventory Position</h3><p><%= asset.knownUnits %> recorded units; <%= asset.incompleteCount %> incomplete inventory items. Quantity or HPP unavailable is excluded from relevant valuation totals. Inventory includes nonarchived drafts awaiting confirmed weights and media.</p></section>
<section><h3>4. Sales &amp; Revenue Performance — Actual</h3><p>Completed POS and Webstore sales from <%= plan.period.fromInput %> through the as-of instant, using existing UTC transaction-period semantics. Revenue is <%= formatIdr(accounting.revenue) %> across <%= accounting.saleCount %> completed sales. Manual income remains cash-only.</p>
<p data-legacy-disclosure><%= plan.legacySales %> completed sales are linked to legacy demo SKUs. These records are preserved and must not be presented as sales history of the newly imported owner workbook catalog. Catalog archival does not remove their accounting history.</p></section>
<section><h3>5. Gross Margin / Profitability</h3><p>Gross profit: <%= amount(accounting.grossProfit) %>. Operating expenses: <%= formatIdr(accounting.operatingExpenses) %>. Net profit: <%= amount(accounting.netProfit) %>.</p><p><%= accounting.missingItemCount %> historical lines lack HPP; <%= accounting.missingSaleCount %> completed sales lack item records. A known COGS subtotal alone does not establish complete historical profit.</p></section>
<section><h3>6. Cash Flow Position</h3><p>Recorded income <%= formatIdr(plan.cash.income) %> less recorded expenses <%= formatIdr(plan.cash.expenses) %>; ending balance <%= formatIdr(plan.cash.endingBalance) %>. Voided ledger entries are excluded. Cash Flow is not profit or a bank reconciliation.</p></section>
<section><h3>7. Asset Base — Current Position</h3><p>Inventory at HPP <%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %> plus active fixed assets at acquisition <%= formatIdr(asset.fixedValue) %> gives combined recorded assets <%= formatIdr(asset.combinedValue) %>. No depreciation/book value is calculated.</p></section>
<section><h3>8. 12-Month Operating Plan</h3><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">State</th><th scope="col">Operating priority</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th scope="row">Operational Now</th><td>Maintain inventory and direct-cost/HPP records; use POS for active, sellable inventory; maintain the finance ledger, Cash Flow and Accounting Lite.</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Operational Now</th><td>Use catalog/media management, customer cart and unpaid order creation/cancellation. An unpaid order is not completed revenue.</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Planned</th><td>Confirm unspecified stock and shipping weights; complete real product photography; review and publish the imported drafts for sale.</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Planned</th><td>Develop payment completion and shipping provider integration in a future phase. These capabilities are not live in this build.</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Planned</th><td>Build reliable complete-period sales/HPP and expense evidence before using a financial run rate.</td></tr>
</tbody></table><p>These priorities span the next 12 months; no unsupported monthly sales, headcount or funding targets are asserted.</p></section>
<section><h3>9. Prospective / Outlook</h3><h4>Current inventory sales capacity</h4><p>Known-stock retail value: <%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %>. HPP value: <%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %>. Potential gross value for the complete stock-and-cost cohort: <%= formatIdr(asset.grossSpread) %> (comparable retail <%= formatIdr(asset.comparativeRetail) %>).</p><p>Potential gross value is NOT projected profit. It excludes operating expenses, discounts, unsold inventory risk, fees, tax, returns and shipping/payment costs. Retail value is not guaranteed revenue.</p>
<h4>12-Month Financial Projection</h4>
<% if (!plan.projection) { %><p data-projection-unavailable>12-month financial projection is not yet reliable due to insufficient complete historical operating data.</p><% } else { const projection = plan.projection; %>
<p data-projection-available>System-derived run-rate projection based on recorded historical performance, not a guaranteed forecast. Qualifying period: <%= projection.from %> to <%= projection.to %>, <%= projection.months %> complete months / <%= projection.days %> complete days.</p>
<dl class="report-metrics"><dt>12-month revenue run rate</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(projection.revenue) %></dd><dt>COGS run rate</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(projection.cogs) %></dd><dt>Gross profit run rate</dt><dd><%= formatIdr(projection.grossProfit) %></dd><dt>Expense run rate</dt><dd><%= projection.expenses === null ? 'Unavailable — expense coverage not confirmed' : formatIdr(projection.expenses) %></dd><dt>Net profit run rate</dt><dd><%= projection.netProfit === null ? 'Unavailable — expense coverage not confirmed' : formatIdr(projection.netProfit) %></dd></dl>
<% } %>
<p>Methodology: only explicitly documented sales-complete calendar months immediately preceding the current UTC month qualify, with at least 30 complete days, complete sale-item HPP and no itemless completed sales. Run rate = qualifying actual total × 12 ÷ complete months, truncated toward zero to whole Rupiah. Expense and net projections additionally require confirmed expense coverage for every month. No evidence is inferred from elapsed time since a first sale. Coverage evidence has no editable forecasting UI in this phase.</p></section>
<section><h3>10. Risks &amp; Data Limitations</h3><ul><li>Actual figures originate from LOKKA operational records and include disclosed legacy/demo-linked history.</li><li>Missing historical HPP limits historical profit calculations; current costs never backfill sold-item snapshots.</li><li>Incomplete stock/cost rows are disclosed and excluded from relevant totals. Disposed assets are excluded from active acquisition value.</li><li>Prospective values, if shown, use the stated methodology. Inventory retail value is not guaranteed revenue.</li><li>Recorded acquisition value is not depreciated book value. No new financing, growth rate, tax estimate or future staffing is assumed.</li></ul></section>
</article>
